        },
        {
            "section_id": "section_1",
            "type": "verse",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "There's an infestation in my mind's imagination",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "1",
                    "text": "I hope that they choke on smoke, 'cause I'm smokin' them out the basement",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "2",
                    "text": "This is not rap, this is not hip-hop",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "3",
                    "text": "Just another attempt to make the voices stop",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "4",
                    "text": "Rappin' to prove nothin', just writin' to say somethin'",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "5",
                    "text": "'Cause I wasn't the only one who wasn't rushin' to sayin' nothin'",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "6",
                    "text": "This doesn't mean I lost my dream",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "7",
                    "text": "It's just right now I got a really crazy mind to clean",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "section_id": "section_2",
            "type": "pre-chorus",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "Gangsters don't cry, therefore, therefore I'm (I'm)",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "1",
                    "text": "Mr. Misty-eyed, therefore I'm (I'm)",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "section_id": "section_3",
            "type": "chorus",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "Can you save? Can you save my?",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "1",
                    "text": "Can you save my heavy, dirty soul?",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "2",
                    "text": "Can you save? Can you save my?",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "3",
                    "text": "Can you save my heavy, dirty soul?",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "4",
                    "text": "For me, for me (Uh)",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "5",
                    "text": "Can you save my heavy, dirty soul?",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "6",
                    "text": "For me, for me (Uh)",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "7",
                    "text": "Can you save my heavy, dirty soul?",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "section_id": "section_4",
            "type": "verse",
            "performer": "",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "Nah, I didn't understand a thing you said",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "1",
                    "text": "If I didn't know better, I'd guess you're all already dead",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "2",
                    "text": "Mindless zombies walkin' around with a limp and a hunch",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "3",
                    "text": "Sayin' stuff like, \"You only live once\"",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "4",
                    "text": "You've got one time to figure it out",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "5",
                    "text": "One time to twist, and one time to shout",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "6",
                    "text": "One time to think and I say we start now",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                },
                {
                    "n": "7",
                    "text": "Sing it with me if you know what I'm talkin' about",
                    "persona_id": "Clancy"
                }
            ]
        },
